    <h2 id="src-h2">Sources</h2>
    <ol class="qa-src-list">
      <li id="src-1">Boarman, W.I. & Heinrich, B. (1999). Common Raven (<em>Corvus corax</em>). <em>Birds of the World</em>. Cornell Lab. — vocal repertoire, vocal learning.</li>
      <li id="src-2">Dickens, C. (1868). <em>Preface to Barnaby Rudge</em>. Chapman & Hall. — historical account of Grip the raven's mimicry.</li>
      <li id="src-3">Heinrich, B. (2000). <em>Mind of the Raven</em>. HarperCollins. — wild mimicry, wolf-raven interactions.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="qa-claim-note"><strong class="claim-science">[science]</strong> peer-reviewed/field-guide data</p>
  </section>
